      "title": "Dodi Helps His Mother at the Market",
      "body": [
        "Every Sunday morning, Dodi goes to the market with his mother. The market is busy and colorful. There are fruits, vegetables, fish, and many other things.",
        "Today, Mother buys tomatoes, carrots, and spinach. The basket becomes heavy, so Dodi carries it for her. He is only nine, but he is strong and always happy to help.",
        "Before they go home, Mother buys Dodi a bowl of bakso, his favorite food. 'Thank you for helping me,' she says. Dodi eats his bakso with a big smile."
